---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
const path = '/tarot-career-reading';
---
<BaseLayout
  title="Tarot Career Reading — Daily Cards for Work and Money"
  description="Use daily tarot for career, work, and money. What the cards say about your professional path today."
  path={path}
>
  <article class="prose">
    <h1>Daily Tarot for Career</h1>
    <p>
      A career reading is most useful when you ask a specific question: <em>What should I focus on at work
      this week?</em> rather than <em>Will I get promoted?</em>
    </p>
    <p>
      For work and money, the most relevant suits are Pentacles (material world) and Wands (action, energy,
      career). The Major Arcana cards <em>The Emperor</em>, <em>The Chariot</em>, and <em>Strength</em> are
      strong career indicators.
    </p>
    <p>
      <a class="btn" href="/">Draw today's career reading →</a>
    </p>
  </article>
</BaseLayout>
